9781d1d409e272f7c34d162295d23b505d5d23","text":"增补（关于部分修订473项法律以规范复杂法律术语的总统令）<第31380号，2021年1月5日>\n\n本法令自颁布之日起生效。<但书略>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00029","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3073,"end":3096,"target_id":"95d38d8ca250f884dee0d50aa184977a0336a2a884a21a32b1eb2cb0b319f451","source_hash":"d71e529cc37726267b649bdc5c15c4218b362b7408cae137bbaf41debc7bf9c4","text":"补充规定 <第31662号，2021年5月4日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00030","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3096,"end":3125,"target_id":"c02fae8a7ff8ff4b6ce307acd181d2259ac8a605d29ca713d7397645002ef6e5","source_hash":"7e5f07ffff6aef2f2136019cfb5263979ba5a34dacd8394c05b2d3c719360d57","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00031","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3125,"end":3204,"target_id":"be92ff93af17ea3529461ae12f3e1068e66b1e5e704c30bf67d6a285eec267f9","source_hash":"051e55c23db5371d9a578d15c21c54536637af9a4127b625579d8225f27b4921","text":"第 2 条（适用于安哥拉优惠关税）附件 1 注释 3 的修订规定适用于 2021 年 2 月 12 日或之后申报进口的货物。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00032","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3204,"end":3229,"target_id":"2640f46db42b78a71e24a9a093c5e4d205be117e0fbfc173b42a62f0a3edbc22","source_hash":"306a62e587724734188631fea3180639f7613013c29cbf0fd03f6dda66d18f1d","text":"补充规定 <第32279号，2021年12月31日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00033","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3229,"end":3264,"target_id":"dada876a4bd5ad03c8f79586dee7f793430966b9d4dae53f762ac659b538d001","source_hash":"93c6bc8f78619141d0db1e78586810f4f9854d4f3362c3cd7f1ec35ef94db466","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法令自2022年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00034","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"BODY","start":3264,"end":3336,"target_id":"bc611ae0ed616a90c8c093316fefa73c3e70855489d28610efe1025b60a6b1d9","source_hash":"947cfdee3f5dd603e3977fc50bf38c07c4aff89430ea511163fa3052d6fe3c53","text":"第 2 条（适用于优惠商品的商品编号和名称）附件 2 的修订规定适用于在本法令生效之日或之后提交进口申报的商品。\n\n"},{"id"