纸 54g/㎡(再生纸))"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00040","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255195","source_hash":"d6d87e05c543e71cabaccf3ed61804e7e814d1a465e94f4fdc59f331ba61f822","text":"(返回)"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00041","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255196","source_hash":"caab9fbc7fe34b9aa7e6bd7521b2f5bc6625e50d0e32613f869ecb320fa506fd","text":"1. 一般条件"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00042","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255197","source_hash":"a4e45cc7aa2af1c38d79d9ebd2303830a77621f379880cecc7e60cd40dbf5753","text":"最不发达国家的出口产品必须满足以下条件才能享受优惠关税。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00043","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255198","source_hash":"be22e4df73b118edaf060b93ccbd56e70da1d2d00b1137c16df6255bd339ca19","text":"可以做到。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00044","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255199","source_hash":"f08a198a74663b8e3e9a4d80a66a77c79d7bb74f1b4979246e1a6b3455dc5854","text":"a. 根据大韩民国《向最不发达国家提供优惠关税》 给予的优惠待遇"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00045","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255200","source_hash":"9fdf85ecbf005dc23457b55318737fcc7913b1904ff5b20ea25592f3f94fd26a","text":"MTQ189381e1ca307f1c01469 必须是起始项。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00046","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255201","source_hash":"83137ad3d79cf117f16256e6b7afb4592a2260498a80815656e2c54d724f1d68","text":"b. 根据大韩民国《向最不发达国家提供优惠关税条例》第五条"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00047","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255202","source_hash":"f1b801b47730fcd6ea56050a94b206415dba0d166992004d784d91c728c3cfab","text":"必须满足其他原产地规则，并且每个运输物品的"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00048","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255203","source_hash":"f6e71727bd1f7b3b901bf2a46fe7dc8a2a932d15169ee6c55a29556ce4b6f57b","text":"必须命名。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00049","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255204","source_hash":"28bdd0a072c6a002aceeeef9c3b5080f9ca8aac2f6d6f67f1c40997165118d49","text":"。通常情况下，必须直接从出口国运往韩国。但是，"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00050","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255205","source_hash":"0fa8f40e378695ed5b08957287ce2a8fa941f3b5c00a81470aad461d8dce25ac","text":"就声音而言，它被认为是直接传输到大韩民国的。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00051","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255206","source_hash":"5f3410ac7cdcc25a192d3f287e38743ae3c6c890c6e94d76afacd2169ec6fb51","text":"1) 如果非原产地货物仅仅因为地理或运输原因而过境，或者非原产地货物"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00052","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255207","source_hash":"c03edfdf9920efbe87d2fc8094cec857f146cdd4afbfe80e2aaafc78fb70aca8","text":"货物被确认已在生产区域的保税区内转运或临时存储的情况"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00053","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255209","source_hash":"05ec02aa637c2c31f55cefb9cdccd0dc7d661f434a5f589cd56a92a0b3d3d2a5","text":"2) 出口到非原产国，用于在展览会、贸易展等场合展出，然后作为活动物种"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00054","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255210","source_hash":"4a2b1da68f7d73a22bd5e21bf75ac5c42d4a14293b9198dd62aa66cac738d88c","text":"如果在 START  之后再出口到大韩民国"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00055","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255211","source_hash":"e19222c2fd16cfb7cf4b5e26991eca677e28092db841a0bbeef9fae5c14295c9","text":"2. 填写正面第 8 部分的方法"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00056","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255212","source_hash":"f1689ca38d3b5cd4cf505477ff4604f1a0e6270712e1597f4a90a8fd3d4cd2b4","text":"优惠物项源自“向最不发达国家提供优惠关税”"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00057","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255213","source_hash":"3e8e35437b23d3e42e91f981c77a160665a062dd8914c33ebfa75fa5a2432865","text":"出口国完全生产或完全取得的符合规定（第5条第1款）的货物，以及"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00058","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255214","source_hash":"29d84e7e40b1f9bf1d6e31b6aa464ccb3d17124480b951f5933e88ca1fb2db08","text":"它是部分生产或部分获得的产品（第5条第2款）。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00059","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255215","source_hash":"d78565677761290094bf13f95d5174624c3c92e4bfa8c090e1b5e065aa053330","text":"a. 完全生产或完全获得的产品在第 8 列中标记为 A。"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00060","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255216","source_hash":"a96b5a65460466feabe510a4b5d2ff80dd8579f0e3d791e9592e3344e952895a","text":"b. 部分生产或部分采购的货物应在第 8 列中标记为 B，其中 B 后跟非出口国"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00061","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255217","source_hash":"c87b45e19fdf45a01cd4cceb7e0ff711f734273a15db564a83fd2a3aef8b16a4","text":"购买的原材料价格，或出口货物"},{"id":"A30623-zh-00062","doc":"A30623","law_id":"kr-005246-280905-ko","scope":"ANNEX","start":null,"end":null,"target_id":"XML:2255218","source_hash":"8f40b7113bafe73db4e8300d3be68fd5cbb8bf49c13ea88d627a4ddaae9d15ea","text":"请以离岸价 (FOB) 的百分比表示（例如，B 40%）。"}]}